sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting, coupled to lumenized Poiseuille flow, wall-shear pruning and arteriovenous specification (Pass 3) — Morphometric validation: 83/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L2045-2223) now returns 14 reference-anchored measurements; the five new hemodynamic metrics (L2078-2131) are WT median capillary wall shear stress 1.0555 Pa (ref 1.5, band 1-2), emergent Murray exponent 3.5264 (ref 3.0), max Kirchhoff residual 6.7e-26 m^3/s (ref 0), DAPT/WT perfused-density ratio 1.625 (ref 1.5, band 1.3-2.0) and WT AV segregation index 1.0 (ref 1.0; DAPT 0.5, no-flow 0.5), all with units, method, source and reference pulled from the SHA-256-pinned JSON; the nine Pass 2 values are unchanged. Deductions: measurement 7 (sweep Pearson r = 0.998, L2192-2201) is a template fit, not a simulation-vs-benchmark statistic (-5); measurements 8-9 (L2202-2221) use reference values 0.1967 and 0.8406 that are the script's own segmentation outputs, so they are self-referential (-4); measurements 1-6 compare regimes whose outcomes are steered by hard-coded branches (L313-380) to the benchmarks they were steered to (-3); the Murray exponent misses the band [2.7, 3.3] by 0.23 and the self-test widens the band by +/-0.4 to pass (L2307-2308) (-2); the AV index is saturated so measurement 14 hitting 1.0 is weakly discriminating, and three references are bands/qualitative rather than points (-3)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py L2192–L2201: Measurement 7: Pearson r of the Section 4 sweep, whose k_t > 0 points are templates (circular) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py#L2192-L2201>",
            "2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py L2202–L2221: Measurements 8-9: reference_value 0.1967 / 0.8406 are the script's own specimen segmentation outputs, not external values <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py#L2202-L2221>",
            "2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py L2306–L2309: Self-test widens the Murray band by +/-0.4 (k = 3.53 vs band [2.7, 3.3]) to pass <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py#L2306-L2309>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-dapt-notch-blockade-k-t-0-0-all-tip-hypersprouting-fraction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-dll4-haploinsufficiency-heterozygote-tip-cell-fraction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-high-uniform-vegf-overload-synchronous-dll4-oscillation-cv>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-huvec-angiogenic-sprouting-plexus-specimen-sprouting-tip-to-junction-ratio>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-huvec-angiogenic-sprouting-plexus-specimen-vascular-area-density>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-notch-blockade-dapt-to-wt-perfused-segment-density-ratio-after-pruning>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-notch-trans-activation-gain-sweep-tip-cell-fraction-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-physiological-salt-and-pepper-brillouin-k-pi-period-2-alternation-index>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-physiological-vegf-salt-and-pepper-regime-tip-cell-fraction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-wt-notch-gated-arteriovenous-ephrinb2-ephb4-marker-segregation-index>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-wt-perfused-plexus-maximum-kirchhoff-node-mass-conservation-residual>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-wt-perfused-plexus-median-capillary-wall-shear-stress-after-remodelling>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-wt-remodelled-plexus-emergent-murray-bifurcation-exponent>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-wt-vegfr2-mosaic-chimera-wild-type-tip-cell-occupancy>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation-2> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.83"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-dapt-notch-blockade-k-t-0-0-all-tip-hypersprouting-fraction> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
