        schema:measurementTechnique "Brent root of r_p^k - r_a^k - r_c^k at every perfused arteriolar bifurcation of the remodelled network (median; OLS log Q vs log r slope = 3.595, R^2 = 0.949); k is NOT a parameter of the model" ;
        schema:name "WT remodelled plexus emergent Murray bifurcation exponent" ;
        schema:unitText "radius exponent k (r_p^k = sum r_d^k)" ;
        schema:value "3.5264" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-wt-remodelled-plexus-emergent-murray-bifurcation-exponent-reference> .

